makemoney.menuClick.task.list.desc:
Supports two types of tasks:

1. Menu click task: After opening the menu, simulate mouse operation.

2. Instruction task: Send command to the server.

Menu Click Task Format: §7<ClickType> <Button> <Slot> [Delay]§r

§7ClickType§r: Mouse operation type

§7Button§r: Mouse button type

§7Slot§r: The slot where the target item is located, the first slot number in the top left corner of the menu is 0.

§7Delay§r: Optional, the interval from the current command to the next command is the default interval for command execution.

Supported mouse operation types (case insensitive):

1. pickUp: Mouse click，Button can be 0 or 1，representing left and right buttons respectively;

2. quickMove: shift+mouse click，Button value same as pickUp;

3. swap: Swap item location. Button can be 0-8 and 40, representing 9 quick bars and offhand;

4. throw: drop item. 0 means discard 1 item, 1 means discard the entire set of items;

5. clone: Click the middle mouse button, and the Button can take any value;

6. pickUpAll: Double click with the left mouse button. 0 represents searching backwards from the beginning of the container, while 1 is the opposite.


The command task is in the format of a string that must start with "/".
